@startuml "Validation des billets - Organisateur"

title Validation des billets à l'entrée

actor "Organisateur" as Organizer
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Validation des billets ==
Organizer -> Frontend: Scanner QR code (app mobile)
Frontend -> API: POST /api/tickets/validate
note right: Body: {qrCode, eventId}
API -> Auth: Vérifier rôle ORGANIZER + propriété événement
Auth --> API: validation authorized

API -> TicketSvc: validateTicket(qrCode, eventId)
TicketSvc -> DB: SELECT ticket WITH qr_code WHERE code=? AND eventId=?
DB --> TicketSvc: ticket data

alt Billet valide et non utilisé
    TicketSvc -> DB: UPDATE tickets SET status='used', usedAt=NOW()
    DB --> TicketSvc: ticket marked as used
    
    TicketSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO ticket_validations (ticketId, validatedBy, validatedAt)
    DB --> TicketSvc: validation logged
    
    TicketSvc --> API: validation success
    API --> Frontend: {status: 'valid', ticketInfo}
    Frontend --> Organizer: "✅ Billet valide - Accès autorisé"
    
else Billet déjà utilisé
    TicketSvc --> API: {status: 'already_used', usedAt}
    API --> Frontend: ticket already used
    Frontend --> Organizer: "❌ Billet déjà utilisé"
    
else Billet invalide
    TicketSvc --> API: {status: 'invalid'}
    API --> Frontend: invalid ticket
    Frontend --> Organizer: "❌ Billet invalide"
end

@enduml